#: web-components/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A plain TypeScript app (via Vite) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"and using\n"
"framework-agnostic custom elements from\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` imports `@pantoken/css` (defines every `--instui-*` custom "
"property),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (`.instui-*` classes),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component "
"behaviors out of the\n"
"  box), and `@pantoken/web-components` (auto-registers elements like "
"`<instui-icon>`), then\n"
"  renders markup into `#app`.\n"
"- Optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) are marked "
"with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — replace their contents with your own markup.\n"
"- Use custom elements directly in markup, e.g. `<instui-button>`, `<instui-"
"alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  see the [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  for the full element list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [HTML guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Une application TypeScript simple (via Vite) stylisée avec\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"et utilisant\n"
"des éléments personnalisés indépendants du framework provenant de\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Développer\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Ce qui se trouve ici\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` importe `@pantoken/css` (définit chaque propriété "
"personnalisée `--instui-*`),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (classes `.instui-*`),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (configure les comportements des modaux, info-"
"bulles et autres composants immédiatement),\n"
"  et `@pantoken/web-components` (enregistre automatiquement les éléments "
"comme `<instui-icon>`), puis\n"
"  affiche le balisage dans `#app`.\n"
"- Les points d'insertion facultatifs (en-tête, filtres, contenu, fin) sont "
"marqués avec\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — remplacez leur contenu par votre propre "
"balisage.\n"
"- Utilisez les éléments personnalisés directement dans le balisage, par "
"exemple `<instui-button>`, `<instui-alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  consultez le [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/"
"package/@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  pour la liste complète des éléments.\n"
"\n"
"## En savoir plus\n"
"\n"
"Consultez le [guide HTML](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) pour en "
"savoir plus.\n"
